// AWS RDS Snapshot Shared Externally  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1537
// Detects sharing of RDS snapshots (ModifyDBSnapshotAttribute/ModifyDBClusterSnapshotAttribute) with other accounts or all (restore=all). A…
// False positives: Legitimate snapshot sharing with known partner accounts (allowlist).
// Source: rules/exfiltration/rds-modify-db-snapshot-attribute.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("ModifyDBSnapshotAttribute", "ModifyDBClusterSnapshotAttribute")) and eventSource =~ "rds.amazonaws.com"
